WEBVTT

00:00:02.010 --> 00:00:03.920
The Peony Unit is now on patrol.

00:00:04.010 --> 00:00:05.550
Each unit, after fanning
out in the designated area,

00:00:05.640 --> 00:00:07.430
you have permission to
release your weapon locks.

00:00:07.510 --> 00:00:09.430
Correction on the data for
the flight course is completed.

00:00:09.510 --> 00:00:11.100
The third descending unit
is now descending from orbit.

00:00:11.180 --> 00:00:13.430
Roger. The weather
on the course is clear.

00:00:13.520 --> 00:00:15.310
The descending units have priority use

00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:18.020
of the channels 8 to 20
for their communications.

00:00:18.110 --> 00:00:21.440
The fourth descending unit will be
dispatched in 20 minutes as scheduled.

00:00:21.530 --> 00:00:24.280
This unit includes the
equipment transport shuttle.

00:00:24.360 --> 00:00:28.120
For the security formation-mapping
program, use descent model A1 0.

00:00:28.200 --> 00:00:29.990
The surveillance unit
has discovered the remains

00:00:30.080 --> 00:00:34.120
There can't be many resources on Earth.
 of a Tribe of Bronze colony...

00:00:34.210 --> 00:00:38.290
Even this blue planet
didn't mean much to them, huh?

00:00:43.300 --> 00:00:44.550
It's beautiful.

00:01:00.820 --> 00:01:04.070
Humanity's homeland...

00:01:05.650 --> 00:01:09.030
No good, we're running
six seconds behind schedule.

00:01:09.120 --> 00:01:12.410
Men, don't be staring at the
scenery on this planet. Stay alert!

00:01:15.120 --> 00:01:21.540
<b>Tooku kirameku hoshi ni ikudo mo watashi wa negau</b>

00:01:21.630 --> 00:01:27.720
<b>Samayoeru kodou gravitation hikareau story</b>

00:01:41.360 --> 00:01:48.070
<b>Hajimari wa itsukara owari wa nanbito shirazu</b>

00:01:48.150 --> 00:01:55.160
<b>Mayakashi demo maboroshi demo naku sakaraenu nagare</b>

00:01:55.250 --> 00:01:57.080
<b>(Kurai)</b>

00:01:57.160 --> 00:02:02.130
<b>Yami ni sumishi mamono</b>

00:02:02.210 --> 00:02:03.960
<b>(Blight)</b>

00:02:04.050 --> 00:02:07.590
<b>Tayasuku nomikomareru youni watashi wa</b>

00:02:07.670 --> 00:02:09.090
<b>(Eiyuu wo motomu)</b>

00:02:09.180 --> 00:02:11.930
<b>Mezame arugamama</b>

00:02:12.010 --> 00:02:20.600
<b>Arishi yume ni arasoi wa tsukimono to kami ga iunara</b>

00:02:20.690 --> 00:02:25.610
<b>Kono mi kirisaite demo looking for</b>

00:02:25.690 --> 00:02:34.410
<b>Hana wo mune ni ugokidashita kodou wa dare nimo can't stop</b>

00:02:34.490 --> 00:02:38.540
<b>Fureau ga sadame</b>

00:02:46.250 --> 00:02:48.420
Bee, what's going on with Mr. Hero?

00:02:48.510 --> 00:02:51.840
He shows no signs of waking up, Master.

00:02:51.930 --> 00:02:54.760
What are the chances he'll wake
up before the other one does?

00:02:54.850 --> 00:02:57.470
That's unknown due to insufficient data.

00:02:59.520 --> 00:03:03.310
The princess said we had
nothing to worry about, but...

00:03:15.200 --> 00:03:20.000
If the enemy Nodos wakes up
and starts acting violently...

00:03:20.080 --> 00:03:23.830
The survival rate of the crew would
be a figure virtually identical to zero.

00:03:23.920 --> 00:03:26.000
I know that much myself!

00:03:26.090 --> 00:03:27.290
Gravitational disturbance detected.

00:03:27.380 --> 00:03:30.460
Some of the forward ships of
the Calydonian Fleet have arrived.

00:03:30.550 --> 00:03:33.590
That's Nilval for you.
She's already caught up with us, huh?

00:04:03.870 --> 00:04:08.170
This is the birthplace of humanity...

00:04:08.250 --> 00:04:11.880
Welcome to the holy land.
We already checked the place.

00:04:11.970 --> 00:04:14.220
So you can bring your
remaining fleets without worries.

00:04:14.300 --> 00:04:16.430
You managed to get the
raging Nodos under control,

00:04:16.510 --> 00:04:19.510
dodge the enemies, and reach Earth.

00:04:19.600 --> 00:04:22.770
It's hard to believe a
single ship achieved so much.

00:04:22.850 --> 00:04:25.890
It's thanks to our princess
and the devil's own luck.

00:04:25.980 --> 00:04:28.770
I should report to the Council
immediately, but what happened

00:04:28.860 --> 00:04:30.270
to the princes?

00:04:30.360 --> 00:04:32.860
They're being respectfully
kept in our custody.

00:04:32.940 --> 00:04:35.570
I wish I could send them out to
be with our unfortunate comrades,

00:04:35.660 --> 00:04:37.910
who had to be reduced to space dust.

00:04:37.990 --> 00:04:41.950
Sorry to tell you this, but I don't
think the princess would want that.

00:04:49.960 --> 00:04:52.920
Oh, our mother planet, Earth!

00:04:53.010 --> 00:04:58.220
Bless your servant who has
survived so many uphill battles!

00:04:58.300 --> 00:05:02.260
I can't believe we are having such
a great moment in a room like this!

00:05:02.350 --> 00:05:04.770
But this is all because of
our hard work, not Dhianeila's.

00:05:04.850 --> 00:05:09.730
I'm sure the Council
will realize that as well.

00:05:09.810 --> 00:05:16.900
Of course they will. However,
the real battle has yet to begin.

00:05:16.990 --> 00:05:19.570
Huh? Are there other
planets to be reclaimed?

00:05:19.660 --> 00:05:21.990
No, Atalantes!

00:05:22.080 --> 00:05:24.240
There are planets to be seizZed!

00:05:24.330 --> 00:05:28.250
In order to get our revenge on the
Tribe of Silver and the Tribe of Bronze!

00:05:28.330 --> 00:05:31.340
Oh, I see! So we're
going to attack their planets.

00:05:31.420 --> 00:05:34.420
There will be no victory unless
we destroy humanity's enemies!

00:05:34.510 --> 00:05:39.300
We'll show our foolish
sister who the real king is!

00:05:44.680 --> 00:05:46.430
So, we're going to do this

00:05:46.520 --> 00:05:49.480
right when the princes make
a plea to the Council, huh...

00:05:51.480 --> 00:05:54.650
Bee, send our personal
message to the Council

00:05:54.730 --> 00:05:56.940
as soon as you intercept
the princes' communication.

00:05:57.030 --> 00:05:59.280
Yes, Master.

00:05:59.360 --> 00:06:02.700
Now, let's see when Mr. Hero wakes up...

00:06:07.790 --> 00:06:10.370
So, you're telling me
that Mehitak has died?

00:06:10.460 --> 00:06:12.830
He fought until there
was no strength left in him.

00:06:12.920 --> 00:06:15.880
Just like his agreement with
the Tribe of Silver told him to do.

00:06:18.380 --> 00:06:20.010
No matter.

00:06:20.090 --> 00:06:23.890
If he's still alive he'll be back.
Back to his own tribe.

00:06:23.970 --> 00:06:25.930
If he doesn't want it to perish...

00:06:27.520 --> 00:06:30.390
So you lost again,
trying to control the madness.

00:06:30.480 --> 00:06:35.320
Can you beat that opponent without
exhausting all your powers, Karkinos?

00:06:35.400 --> 00:06:39.360
If you order me to,
I'll fight next time, even if I go mad.

00:06:42.410 --> 00:06:45.370
As long as I'm out there fighting,
you're not needed.

00:06:49.160 --> 00:06:51.870
Yuty's anger is inevitable.

00:06:51.960 --> 00:06:56.420
After all, three of us together
failed against the fifth Nodos.

00:06:58.510 --> 00:07:02.510
She's just relieved that you're okay.

00:07:02.590 --> 00:07:04.390
I'm sure Mehitak is okay.

00:07:04.470 --> 00:07:11.020
That fifth one...
Age wouldn't kill a defeated opponent.

00:07:11.100 --> 00:07:14.400
I'm going to see Prome-sama.

00:07:14.480 --> 00:07:16.650
If you want to avoid Yuty's revenge,

00:07:16.730 --> 00:07:18.570
you should go make her feel better now.

00:07:27.490 --> 00:07:33.920
Prome O, why did the
Tribe of Iron seek that planet?

00:07:34.000 --> 00:07:37.630
It is functioning as their
vital behavioral principle.

00:07:37.710 --> 00:07:39.050
For them,

00:07:39.130 --> 00:07:43.050
that planet is the place where
their ancestors were born, Rom Ror.

00:07:43.130 --> 00:07:46.090
What's so significant about their birthplace?

00:07:46.180 --> 00:07:51.600
The Tribe of Iron holds the strongest
emotion towards their oldest home.

00:07:51.680 --> 00:07:55.980
And they'll probably try to fight,
hoping that their opponent

00:07:56.060 --> 00:07:57.900
will have the same emotion.

00:07:57.980 --> 00:08:00.030
Not for their survival?

00:08:00.110 --> 00:08:02.990
For them, survival means emotions.

00:08:03.070 --> 00:08:05.530
And also, they'll
probably follow that principle

00:08:05.620 --> 00:08:08.160
and seek the power of the Tribe of Gold.

00:08:08.240 --> 00:08:10.540
What we sought.

00:08:10.620 --> 00:08:13.870
What we couldn't obtain,
although we sought it.

00:08:13.960 --> 00:08:16.670
The Tribe of Iron
won't be granted it, either.

00:08:16.750 --> 00:08:20.750
They were the very last
ones to come out into space.

00:08:20.840 --> 00:08:23.880
But I think about the fact that
the Tribe of Gold was already

00:08:23.970 --> 00:08:30.430
trying to leave this
universe before they came.

00:08:30.520 --> 00:08:32.850
And about how we once fought

00:08:32.930 --> 00:08:36.560
the Tribe of Gold in order
to prevent them from going.

00:08:36.650 --> 00:08:40.440
I think about why the Tribe of Gold

00:08:40.530 --> 00:08:44.490
was content to fight us instead
of trying to leave right away.

00:08:46.530 --> 00:08:51.490
Maybe it's because the Tribe of Gold
was waiting for the Tribe of Iron...

00:09:10.720 --> 00:09:11.970
Yuty?

00:09:12.060 --> 00:09:13.520
L-Let me go!

00:09:13.600 --> 00:09:16.730
I'm sorry. I thought you were him.

00:09:16.810 --> 00:09:18.650
It's okay.

00:09:19.940 --> 00:09:21.570
Yuty.

00:09:23.610 --> 00:09:30.120
Your anger... I'll calm it by
me staking my life to fight.

00:09:30.200 --> 00:09:35.870
My agreement decrees that
I must protect you from battles.

00:09:35.960 --> 00:09:38.580
Do you think I'll rely on you?

00:09:43.630 --> 00:09:46.260
Forget the agreement...

00:09:53.640 --> 00:09:59.560
The idea that the Tribe of Gold sought
the Tribe of Iron is not one we want.

00:09:59.650 --> 00:10:05.900
But I think about letting the Tribe of Iron
acquire the power of the Tribe of Gold,

00:10:05.990 --> 00:10:09.990
and then having our two
tribes share that power.

00:10:10.070 --> 00:10:16.700
The Tribe of Iron destroys planets.
That thought is our destruction.

00:10:16.790 --> 00:10:20.620
The Tribe of Gold didn't share the power.

00:10:20.710 --> 00:10:23.540
If the Tribe of Iron is going to acquire it,

00:10:23.630 --> 00:10:26.550
we must use all our powers to destroy them.

00:10:26.630 --> 00:10:30.720
I don't think so, Rom Ror.

00:10:30.800 --> 00:10:34.640
The majority of us support my idea.

00:10:44.320 --> 00:10:46.270
Let's destroy them.

00:11:00.040 --> 00:11:01.330
Prome-sama.

00:11:01.420 --> 00:11:05.250
The worries of the tribe are now mine.

00:11:05.340 --> 00:11:06.960
Worries?

00:11:07.710 --> 00:11:10.300
Worries coming from the
fact that the Tribe of Gold,

00:11:10.380 --> 00:11:12.680
which guided us, has left...

00:11:12.760 --> 00:11:18.100
Anger and fear...
No one thinks we should face them.

00:11:18.180 --> 00:11:20.930
Now that we know how to entrust
our emotions to someone else,

00:11:21.020 --> 00:11:25.150
no one believes we should be
separated from that guidance...

00:11:25.230 --> 00:11:30.190
I feel your worries.
How you deeply care about Mehitak...

00:11:32.860 --> 00:11:37.910
There's one more rule left for Mehitak...

00:11:37.990 --> 00:11:40.790
I can't imagine the Tribe of Gold,
which supposedly knows the future,

00:11:40.870 --> 00:11:43.830
left an agreement that
would never come into effect.

00:11:45.380 --> 00:11:48.290
They only decreed the
number of the agreements.

00:11:48.380 --> 00:11:50.630
Although we're the ones who determined them,

00:11:50.720 --> 00:11:52.920
we don't know if they will actually happen.

00:11:53.010 --> 00:11:56.970
Uncovering the true
intentions of the Tribe of Gold,

00:11:57.050 --> 00:12:01.810
which are yet unknown to us,
is part of your agreement.

00:12:01.890 --> 00:12:04.640
I can't see anything.

00:12:04.730 --> 00:12:07.110
Let's think and figure it out together.

00:12:07.190 --> 00:12:10.320
What lies at the end of our duties...

00:12:10.400 --> 00:12:13.030
Yes, Prome-sama...

00:12:14.070 --> 00:12:15.240
Humans!

00:12:15.320 --> 00:12:20.910
Now that we have regained the Earth,
we must launch retaliatory strikes

00:12:21.000 --> 00:12:23.290
on the planets of the Tribe of Bronze
and Tribe of Silver,

00:12:23.370 --> 00:12:25.420
who threaten our survival,

00:12:25.500 --> 00:12:26.790
for the century-long sorrow

00:12:26.880 --> 00:12:29.840
and humiliation that
we were forced to face!

00:12:29.920 --> 00:12:35.180
And let the entire universe know that
we humans are a strong and proud tribe

00:12:37.300 --> 00:12:39.850
He has no military talent whatsoever,

00:12:39.930 --> 00:12:42.720
but when it comes to political
pizzazz he's first-rate.

00:12:42.810 --> 00:12:45.270
Don't you agree, Nilval?

00:12:46.270 --> 00:12:48.900
The Council has reached their conclusion.

00:12:51.030 --> 00:12:52.860
"The Nodos now belongs to the Argonaut

00:12:52.940 --> 00:12:54.690
and we are independent
from the Federation fleet.

00:12:54.780 --> 00:12:58.240
King Meleagros will
continue to command the fleet,

00:12:58.320 --> 00:13:00.240
but for practical purposes,

00:13:00.330 --> 00:13:01.870
the executive commander will be

00:13:01.950 --> 00:13:05.040
Lieutenant General Nilval, who's
been returned to the Azz-Azoth Fleet."

00:13:05.120 --> 00:13:06.790
Something like that?

00:13:06.870 --> 00:13:09.040
Just what kind of magic did you use?

00:13:09.130 --> 00:13:10.710
Oh, nothing special,

00:13:10.800 --> 00:13:13.880
I just suggested to the Council
that it would make them look better

00:13:13.960 --> 00:13:17.760
if that whole thing about
the royals being arrested

00:13:17.840 --> 00:13:20.220
and their authority
seized had never happened.

00:13:20.300 --> 00:13:22.760
Thanks to you, I get to go back
to my old nest and still retain

00:13:22.850 --> 00:13:25.850
the authority to assemble
the entire fleet under the command

00:13:25.940 --> 00:13:29.270
of Princess Dhianeila at any
time in the name of emergency.

00:13:29.360 --> 00:13:31.230
I'm quite impressed by your politicking.

00:13:31.320 --> 00:13:34.230
It's hard to believe you're a man
who almost died on the frontier!

00:13:34.320 --> 00:13:39.070
I can do that much for the princess,
I must dedicate my life to revering.

00:13:39.160 --> 00:13:41.910
Signs of awakening have
been confirmed, Master!

00:13:44.540 --> 00:13:46.910
Wh-Which one is it?!

00:13:47.000 --> 00:13:48.830
"Which one"?

00:14:03.260 --> 00:14:04.890
Dhianeila.

00:14:05.850 --> 00:14:07.100
Yes.

00:14:09.900 --> 00:14:12.520
You were in my dream, too, Dhianeila.

00:14:12.610 --> 00:14:14.230
You were smiling.

00:14:14.320 --> 00:14:20.780
I'm sure it was because
you came back to this ship.

00:14:20.870 --> 00:14:22.320
Age...

00:14:31.540 --> 00:14:33.500
You woke up, Age?!

00:14:35.340 --> 00:14:38.090
You're crying and laughing at
the same time. You got skills.

00:14:38.170 --> 00:14:39.840
I guess you're right.

00:14:42.340 --> 00:14:43.140
You should be smiling

00:14:43.180 --> 00:14:44.930
You can come inside the room now.
 all the time, Dhianeila.

00:14:45.010 --> 00:14:47.810
Dhianella-sama will be fine.
 You think so? By the way,

00:14:47.890 --> 00:14:49.890
That's thanks to Age, too, huh?
  are your wounds better now?

00:14:49.890 --> 00:14:51.940
That's thanks to Age, too, huh?
 Yeah, they're fine.

00:14:51.940 --> 00:14:52.560
That's thanks to Age, too, huh?
 That's good to know!

00:14:52.560 --> 00:14:53.440
I can't keep on losing like this.
My opponent is basically perfect.
 That's good to know!

00:14:53.440 --> 00:14:54.940
I can't keep on losing like this.
My opponent is basically perfect.
 But I was completely

00:14:54.940 --> 00:14:56.820
I can't keep on losing like this.
My opponent is basically perfect.
 worn out at that time.

00:14:56.900 --> 00:14:59.070
I bet you're the only one in this universe
 I'm sorry that I couldn't catch you.

00:14:59.070 --> 00:15:01.490
who's seriously trying to
compete with the Nodos.
 I'm sorry that I couldn't catch you.

00:15:01.570 --> 00:15:02.910
Is that strange?
 No, that's okay. The moment
I saw you I lost all my strength.

00:15:02.910 --> 00:15:04.820
No, that's okay. The moment
I saw you I lost all my strength.

00:15:04.910 --> 00:15:07.580
It's like you, Iolaous.

00:15:12.250 --> 00:15:14.000
What do we do? What do we do?

00:15:14.080 --> 00:15:16.340
We need to call the princess! Princess!

00:15:16.420 --> 00:15:20.170
Princess! Princess! Princess!

00:15:21.130 --> 00:15:22.970
He's out!

00:15:23.050 --> 00:15:25.850
The Nodos' awakening is confirmed!
Your orders, sir?

00:15:25.930 --> 00:15:28.220
For self-defense purposes only,
you have permission to shoot!

00:15:28.310 --> 00:15:29.930
However, use only shock bullets!

00:15:31.230 --> 00:15:33.100
Let's go, Mail!

00:15:33.190 --> 00:15:36.610
Okay! We're not the same as we used to be!

00:15:59.380 --> 00:16:02.420
There's no way they can stop the Nodos...

00:16:02.510 --> 00:16:05.890
Activate defensive
system around Tail and Mail.

00:16:05.970 --> 00:16:07.180
It really...

00:16:07.260 --> 00:16:09.100
...didn't work!

00:16:12.270 --> 00:16:14.100
Age!

00:16:18.440 --> 00:16:20.530
The princess and Age just arrived.

00:16:20.610 --> 00:16:24.200
Let Age handle the Nodos.
Prioritize the security of the princess.

00:16:24.280 --> 00:16:25.570
Roger.

00:16:36.330 --> 00:16:38.290
We're done trying to kill each other.

00:16:41.260 --> 00:16:45.090
We don't have to fight anymore?

00:17:03.110 --> 00:17:07.610
It looks like we don't have to worry,
just like the princess said.

00:17:07.700 --> 00:17:10.120
You witnessed a Nodos on the rampage,

00:17:10.200 --> 00:17:12.620
and then took two of
them onboard your ship...

00:17:12.700 --> 00:17:15.120
You sure are capable of making

00:17:15.210 --> 00:17:18.040
the most unbelievable
decision like it's nothing.

00:17:18.130 --> 00:17:20.210
Keep it a secret, okay?

00:17:20.290 --> 00:17:22.460
The princess has actually been worried

00:17:22.550 --> 00:17:27.050
that humans might kill
that Nodos out of fear.

00:17:27.130 --> 00:17:30.430
I'll do as our star says...

00:17:38.440 --> 00:17:42.980
Mehitak Pore.
I'm Mehitak from the Tribe of Pore.

00:17:43.070 --> 00:17:44.650
I am Dhianeila, the eldest
daughter of the Yunos royal family,

00:17:44.740 --> 00:17:48.070
as well as the leader of
the Altria planet system.

00:17:48.160 --> 00:17:51.530
We warmly welcome the
Nodos of the Tribe of Pore,

00:17:51.620 --> 00:17:53.990
who has accepted a
peaceful settlement with us.

00:17:54.080 --> 00:17:57.500
Does that mean I'm going to
have an agreement with you?

00:17:57.580 --> 00:18:03.710
No. But would you tell us
what kind of agreements you're in?

00:18:08.590 --> 00:18:12.600
As long as I obey the Tribe of Silver,
the Tribe of Pore prospers.

00:18:12.680 --> 00:18:16.680
I must obey the Tribe of Silver until
I exhaust all my powers as a Nodos.

00:18:16.770 --> 00:18:21.440
And I must help when the
Tribe of Silver's Nodos is in danger.

00:18:21.520 --> 00:18:22.770
Those are the three
agreements that I'm in.

00:18:22.860 --> 00:18:25.480
The Tribe of Silver's Nodos...

00:18:25.570 --> 00:18:30.030
Is that person also in
agreements similar to yours?

00:18:30.110 --> 00:18:35.030
She... Yuty has eight agreements.

00:18:35.120 --> 00:18:40.210
The other two... Karkinos
has four and Lecty has five.

00:18:40.290 --> 00:18:44.210
Artemia and I exerted all our
powers to fight Age, then lost,

00:18:44.290 --> 00:18:52.390
so I suppose I no longer
have to obey the Tribe of Silver.

00:18:52.470 --> 00:18:55.430
What's going to happen to your tribe?

00:18:58.140 --> 00:19:05.520
If they find out that I'm here...
Yuty might destroy my home planet.

00:19:05.610 --> 00:19:11.200
If you disobey the Tribe of Silver,
they will destroy your tribe?

00:19:11.280 --> 00:19:14.280
That's why the other
two can't disobey either.

00:19:14.370 --> 00:19:18.240
Besides, Yuty is much,
much stronger than we are.

00:19:18.330 --> 00:19:20.750
She's probably stronger than Age...

00:19:22.580 --> 00:19:25.750
There's no need for you
to worry about your tribe.

00:19:25.840 --> 00:19:26.750
What?

00:19:26.840 --> 00:19:32.720
We will head to the Planet Tauron,
the birthplace of the Tribe of Bronze.

00:19:32.800 --> 00:19:37.220
The planet where your tribe
lives is in the same star system.

00:19:37.310 --> 00:19:40.180
Are you telling me to fight with you?

00:19:40.270 --> 00:19:47.110
No. My wish is that you
don't use your Nodos' power.

00:19:47.190 --> 00:19:52.110
And in return, we will protect your tribe.

00:19:52.200 --> 00:19:53.650
Really?

00:19:53.740 --> 00:19:58.280
This war is between
humankind and the Tribe of Silver.

00:19:58.370 --> 00:20:02.210
We shouldn't involve other
tribes in it in the first place.

00:20:02.290 --> 00:20:07.460
Until the war is over, please stay on
a safe planet so no one will find you.

00:20:07.540 --> 00:20:10.460
Letting the second Nodos go, huh?

00:20:10.550 --> 00:20:15.510
Such a merciful decision. That's our princess.

00:20:15.590 --> 00:20:17.680
Would it be a problem
if I stayed on this ship?

00:20:17.760 --> 00:20:20.220
No, but why?

00:20:20.310 --> 00:20:23.310
Because I don't want you to be destroyed.

00:20:23.390 --> 00:20:30.360
If you really make my tribe safe,
I don't mind fighting for you!

00:20:36.320 --> 00:20:38.240
The wish of the hero

00:20:38.330 --> 00:20:42.160
who sacrificed his feelings
to keep fighting for his own tribe...

00:20:42.250 --> 00:20:45.250
I'll never neglect it.

00:20:45.330 --> 00:20:49.290
We have switched the navigation
controls to the star system exit process.

00:20:49.380 --> 00:20:54.340
No errors detected in the main engine.
Each ship, start up the tracer.

00:20:54.420 --> 00:20:55.930
Astral sign specified.

00:20:56.010 --> 00:20:58.590
A part of the leading
fleet has started moving out

00:20:58.680 --> 00:21:00.930
in time for the arrival of the colonial ships.

00:21:01.010 --> 00:21:04.230
I guess we have to say goodbye
to our homeland for a while, huh?

00:21:07.350 --> 00:21:13.650
I hope it's a good thing for this planet
to have humans live here once again...

00:21:13.740 --> 00:21:15.900
This is the planet that we once lost.

00:21:15.990 --> 00:21:19.200
I'm sure we'll treasure
it more than anything.

00:21:19.280 --> 00:21:26.410
The fact that we had to lose it to
feel that way makes me very worried.

00:21:26.500 --> 00:21:35.380
None of us has yet discovered the most
prosperous path for this universe.

00:21:35.470 --> 00:21:38.720
The twelve agreements given to Age...

00:21:38.800 --> 00:21:42.890
We haven't figured out whether
we're even worth those agreements yet...

00:21:42.970 --> 00:21:46.560
Age will believe in your heart, Dhianeila-sama.

00:21:46.640 --> 00:21:48.940
And the rest of us on
this ship believe, too

00:21:49.020 --> 00:21:51.520
that we can figure this out together.

00:21:52.570 --> 00:21:55.360
Let's just keep going forward for now...

00:22:02.330 --> 00:22:04.450
Hoping that the path yet unseen...

00:22:07.330 --> 00:22:10.290
...that our path is waiting ahead.

00:22:25.520 --> 00:22:33.690
Zutto mae kara kimi no koto shitteita kedo

00:22:33.770 --> 00:22:41.280
Konna kimochi mebaeru nante omowanakatta

00:22:41.370 --> 00:22:46.660
Masaka kimi ni koi suru nante

00:22:46.750 --> 00:22:57.340
Nanige nai kaerimichi
yozora no hoshi wo miage nagara

00:22:57.420 --> 00:23:09.930
Wazato toomawari shite
kimi no kata ni motarete aruku

00:23:10.020 --> 00:23:21.280
Futari de ireba donna kotodemo
norikoeraresou to iu kimi no

00:23:21.360 --> 00:23:26.580
Massugu na me wo mitsumete omou

00:23:26.660 --> 00:23:33.290
Kimi wo aishiteru

00:23:36.000 --> 00:23:37.920
The anxieties of the
surrounding tribes heighten

00:23:38.000 --> 00:23:40.920
as humankind forcefully makes inroads.

00:23:41.010 --> 00:23:45.720
Next time on Heroic Age,
Episode 17: "The Retributive Troops."
